"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
221,"Abu Yahya Muhammad bin Abdul Rahim Al-Bazzaz narrated to us, Muslim bin Ibrahim narrated to us, Shu’bah narrated to us, on the authority of Asim Al-Ahwal, on the authority of Abu Al-Mutawakkil, on the authority of Abu Sa’id, on the authority of the Prophet, may God’s prayers and peace be upon him, said: “If one of you wants to perform ablution, let him perform ablution, for it will be more effective for him in ""the oud"""
